              "text": "most common complication following surgical repair",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "due to prominence of screws and hardware about the knee, resolved upon hardware removal",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "**Vascular Injury**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "to popliteal artery as it passes posteriorly over distal metaphyseal fragment",
